Date: Thu, 23 Apr 2026 14:35:10 +0200
Subject: [RFC PATCH 2/4] virtio_msg: add virtio message bridge

Introduce the virtio-msg bridge device, bridge UAPI, and userspace
documentation for endpoint resolution, attach or detach lifecycle,
userspace-published topology snapshots, control-event delivery, and
map-event driven DMA window publication.

Land the final bridge-facing contract split directly in this patch so
userspace owns dev_num publication from the outset, the ioctl number
allocation is stable, and offline bridge operations report the
documented -ENODEV contract for map-event receive, map-event ack, and
mmap().

Signed-off-by: Bertrand Marquis <bertrand.marquis@arm.com>
